    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a flash-dodging training game specifically designed for <i>VALORANT</i>, featuring nearly all in-game flash effects. It innovatively combines a dot-clicking mechanic, challenging players to precisely hit targets while swiftly avoiding sudden flashes. This dual-tasking gameplay enhances reaction speed and multitasking skills, making it an effective training tool for players.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a flash-dodging training game specifically designed for <i>VALORANT</i>, featuring nearly all in-game flash effects. It innovatively combines a dot-clicking mechanic, challenging players to precisely hit targets while swiftly avoiding sudden flashes. This dual-tasking gameplay enhances reaction speed and multitasking skills, making it an effective training tool for players.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "VALORANT flash-dodging trainer with dot-clicking mini-game. Two modes: \u2460 Practice (customize flashes/targets) \u2461 Time Attack (score under limit). Master flashes while boosting aim!",
